_meanings:
(In <ab>Rhet.</ab>) A figure of speech in which the difference or
 distinction between two objects is shown to be completely obscured on account
 of their similarity, whether natural or artificial, in some respects;
 it is thus defined by Mammaṭa:-- {#samena lakzmaRA vastu vastunA yannigUhyate .#}
 {#nijenAgantunA vApi tanmIlitamiti smftam ..#} <ls>K. P. 10</ls>.
